SSH key for APK repository publication

Files
  id_ed25519: private key used by the CI publication job.
  id_ed25519.pub: public key authorized on the repository server.
  known_hosts: pinned repository server SSH host public key.

Generate in a new, empty directory
  umask 077
  ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -N '' -C 'NAOS APK CI deploy' -f id_ed25519
  chmod 600 id_ed25519
  chmod 644 id_ed25519.pub

Check the public key fingerprint
  ssh-keygen -lf id_ed25519.pub

Obtain the server host public key through an existing trusted SSH connection
and record it in known_hosts with the server hostname or IP address.
